# Unix line endings wherever these are checked out, Windows included: each is
# run by a Unix shell (on a Linux instance, in Git Bash or WSL), which a
# carriage return breaks, and the live tests pin the Agent installer's checksum
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.zsh text eol=lf
*.fish text eol=lf
scripts/pre-push text eol=lf
